# The author's content, not the project's source.
#
# Posts and site.yml are data. They are written by hand, by /admin, by the REST
# API, and by MCP tools — the admin and API paths rewrite site.yml through a
# YAML round trip, so tracking it here would mean every edit made on a running
# site shows up as a diff and every deploy risks a conflict against it.
#
# This is not backed up by being in the repo. Back up content/ and data/
# together; see docs/deploy-erebus.md.
/content/

# Generated
/public/
/data/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Build output
/dist/
/dtcom
/dtcom.exe

# Editor / OS
*.swp
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Env
.env
